                    r2_delegate_hint:       `Professionalization is transferring decision rights, not adding headcount. A GM with no authority is an expensive spectator.`,
                    r2_signatory_label:     `Reset the banking signatory and PO-approval threshold?`,
                    r2_keyaccount_label:    `Build the dedicated key-account / EDI team the retailer requires?`,
