                    terms_headline:         `Accept on the headline 30% — sign the term sheet as offered to close fast`,
                    terms_na:               `Not applicable — no PE in the mix`,

                    r4_timing_label:        `When do you address succession and governance?`,
                    r4_governance_label:    `Which governance architecture do you put in place?`,
                    r4_succession_label:    `Development path for Lucía (34, commercial) and Tomás (31, plant)?`,
