                    timing_proactive:       `Now — design the governance and continuity step before the June surgery, not after`,
                    timing_signal:          `Signal intent now, design it later — name a likely successor verbally, document nothing yet`,
                    timing_defer:           `Defer it — park succession until after the contract stabilizes; the surgery will be fine`,
